Gift was added as Gift Bear's summon in '''Beta 6.6''', where it was a 1G 0/3 Taunt monster. This, however, was nerfed in the very next update, '''Beta 6.7''', where its HP dropped to 2.

Like [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Bunbun Bun], Gift also got at one point a drop in cost from 1G to 0G that was undocumented.

